From: Hermes Agent <hermes@agent.local>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 03:27:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] FXL-2: detect malformed messages with checkMessage

Add checkMessage(candidate, text) to src/framing.js that validates a parsed
FIX message candidate and returns null for valid messages or {number, position,
rule, text} for malformed ones. Checks 7 rules in priority order:
field_without_equals, bad_tag, header_order, missing_checksum, checksum_format,
body_length, checksum. Uses UTF-8 byte counting for BodyLength and CheckSum.
Returns 1-based positions. Error text follows 'Message N: <problem> at position P'.

Add test/framing-f2.test.js with 23 tests covering all 6 acceptance criteria.
